Rust dependencies
-----------------

Every other third-party component is a Rust crate declared in Cargo.toml and
pinned in Cargo.lock. Their licences are recorded in the lockfile's package
metadata and can be listed with:

    cargo install cargo-license
    cargo license

No dependency is vendored into this repository.
